			<data key="d3"><![CDATA[099 · C053 — Regular quasifree provenance state ω_prov
Section 5.3.1: Presymplectic completion, Weyl system and quasifree state / Quasifree-state specialization
Status: CORE_BLOCKED
Contract: Once G and bounded K are admitted, μ=(||K||/2)G gives a positive regular quasifree state.
CNNA architecture role: Reduced observation specialization: positive state and measurement structures are later compressions of the response net.
